rue,"bead_id":"sase-gz.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-gz[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Every notification-panel tab wears an icon[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every notification-panel tab renders a meaningful icon in the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]panel's tab strip and in the top-bar indicator's per-tab chips, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]resolved through a chain that can never come up empty; the Snoozed [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]count sheds its `z` suffix for a moon glyph; and any gate that [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]declares a new panel tab must declare that tab's icon.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]notification_tab_icons.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/notification_tab_icons.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-gz[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-gz/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust core carries a per-tab icon[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-icon[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-icon: add `icon` to the core's notification tab record, donated by [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the newest member row that declares `action_data.panel_icon`, mirroring [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the existing color-donation rule, with defensive validation and tests; [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]land and release it in sase-core.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Icon resolution chain and configuration[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]icon-chain[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]icon-chain: add `resolve_notification_tab_icon` to the tab-style module [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with its four-rung resolution chain, the built-in key and kind glyph [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tables, the `ace.notification_tabs.*.icon` setting, its JSON-schema [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]entry, and the bundled defaults.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gates must declare their panel's icon[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]gate-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]gate-contract: add the required `presentation.panel_icon` gate field, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project it into notification `action_data` as a protected key, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]update both bead gate producers that declare `panel: beads`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render icons in the tab strip and indicator[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after icon-chain[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: draw the icon in the modal tab strip and in every indicator [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chip, replace the snoozed `z` suffix with its glyph, and make every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]width measurement cell-aware so a two-cell icon cannot desync tab click [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ranges or tooltip alignment.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Adopt the released core and verify end to end[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-floor[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-icon, icon-chain, gate-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-floor: raise the `sase-core-rs` floor to the release carrying the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tab icon and verify a gate-declared panel icon reaches the tab strip and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the indicator through the real core.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation and the sase_gate skill contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs-skill[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render, gate-contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs-skill: document tab icons, the reshaped indicator badge, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]new configuration field, and teach the bundled sase_gate skill source [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that a declared panel requires a panel icon.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-gz","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-gz.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-dc23d1716c6809a61e81467d9c6adea7","started_at":"2026-08-07T14:37:55.390659+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"8bda7bb34af8cf4cb78fb8bb704681b9acbb3072ab1b85f6cc8e7f136fc8534a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gz.6/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"ca6d657d971c083628ba5d2d093288a405933a67710a8380ce6625f87cec3c58","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gz.6/meta.json","size_bytes":600},"prompt":{"digest":"9fbe341ae7bceb39c5589236f5ee3640dc1be88b9feccd609fa600099ab4cd38","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gz.6/prompt.md","size_bytes":182},"state":{"digest":"ce25bb3b333be1df389e6c2a6438cd505f07e29afb5535e191d239ab9ae87f4d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-gz.6/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-gz.6","local_name":"sase-gz.6","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-gz","agent_clan_generation":"20260807103025","approve":true,"b